 r←Test_SelectionTool_002(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "SelectionTool.Run" with just autoPress set and no global parms.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←1
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.posn←100 100
 rc←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.Run⍕¨1+⍳10
 →T.FailsIf 2≠⍴rc
 →T.FailsIf 0≠0⊃rc
 r←T._OK
